  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">随机羊颜色（Random Sheep Colours）是一款极简且可配置的模组，它为世界中所有新生成的羊赋予随机的毛皮（羊毛）颜色。繁殖产生的羊不受影响。您可以在配置文件中设置允许生成的颜色。Jeb 羊也受支持，并且默认启用。<br><br><strong>注意：</strong>任何配置更改都需要重启才能生效。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的额外捆绑包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>possibleSheepColours</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"black,blue,brown,cyan,gray,green,jeb,light_blue,light_gray,lime,magenta,orange,pink,purple,red,white,yellow\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模组从中选择的可能羊的颜色列表，以逗号分隔。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自然生成的具有随机颜色的羊：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-sheep-colours/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何模组包中使用此模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他内容，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
